{
  "note": "Expected values were worked out by hand from the fixture files before being saved. '@name' is a fixture path, '@tmp/name' is a path in a fresh temp folder. 'expect' keys are dotted paths into the JSON (digits index lists) or the derived keys flag_types and rejected_reasons.",
  "cases": [
    {
